## Article 236. Suspension of proceedings (mandatory grounds)

```catala
declaration scope Article236MandatorySuspension:
  input suspension content ProceedingSuspension
  output proceedingsMustBeSuspended content YesNo

scope Article236MandatorySuspension:
  label suspend_default definition proceedingsMustBeSuspended equals No

# Death or liquidation with succession
  label suspend_succession exception suspend_default
  definition proceedingsMustBeSuspended under condition
    suspension.mandatoryGround = MandatorySuspensionGround.DeathOrLiquidationWithSuccession
    consequence equals Yes

# Need legal representative
  label suspend_representative exception suspend_default
  definition proceedingsMustBeSuspended under condition
    suspension.mandatoryGround = MandatorySuspensionGround.NeedLegalRepresentative
    consequence equals Yes

# Objective impossibility due to other case
  label suspend_impossibility exception suspend_default
  definition proceedingsMustBeSuspended under condition
    suspension.mandatoryGround = MandatorySuspensionGround.ObjectiveImpossibilityOtherCase
    consequence equals Yes

# Both parties request reconciliation time
  label suspend_reconciliation exception suspend_default
  definition proceedingsMustBeSuspended under condition
    suspension.mandatoryGround = MandatorySuspensionGround.BothPartiesRequestReconciliation
    consequence equals Yes

# Party in military service
  label suspend_military exception suspend_default
  definition proceedingsMustBeSuspended under condition
    suspension.mandatoryGround = MandatorySuspensionGround.PartyInMilitaryService
    consequence equals Yes

# Judicial dispute resolution pending
  label suspend_resolution exception suspend_default
  definition proceedingsMustBeSuspended under condition
    suspension.mandatoryGround = MandatorySuspensionGround.JudicialDisputeResolutionPending
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 236. Suspension of proceedings (discretionary grounds)

```catala
declaration scope Article236DiscretionarySuspension:
  input suspension content ProceedingSuspension
  input personalParticipationRequired content YesNo
  output proceedingsCanBeSuspended content YesNo

scope Article236DiscretionarySuspension:
  label discretionary_default definition proceedingsCanBeSuspended equals No

# Illness of participant
  label suspend_illness exception discretionary_default
  definition proceedingsCanBeSuspended under condition
    suspension.discretionaryGround = DiscretionarySuspensionGround.ParticipantIllness
    and personalParticipationRequired = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Long business trip
  label suspend_trip exception discretionary_default
  definition proceedingsCanBeSuspended under condition
    suspension.discretionaryGround = DiscretionarySuspensionGround.ParticipantLongBusinessTrip
    and personalParticipationRequired = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Alternative or military service
  label suspend_service exception discretionary_default
  definition proceedingsCanBeSuspended under condition
    suspension.discretionaryGround = DiscretionarySuspensionGround.ParticipantAlternativeService
    consequence equals Yes

# Expertise appointed
  label suspend_expertise exception discretionary_default
  definition proceedingsCanBeSuspended under condition
    suspension.discretionaryGround = DiscretionarySuspensionGround.ExpertiseAppointed
    consequence equals Yes

# Cassation review of similar case
  label suspend_cassation exception discretionary_default
  definition proceedingsCanBeSuspended under condition
    suspension.discretionaryGround = DiscretionarySuspensionGround.CassationReviewSimilarCase
    consequence equals Yes

# Court commission pending
  label suspend_commission exception discretionary_default
  definition proceedingsCanBeSuspended under condition
    suspension.discretionaryGround = DiscretionarySuspensionGround.CourtCommissionPending
    consequence equals Yes

# Foreign court request
  label suspend_foreign exception discretionary_default
  definition proceedingsCanBeSuspended under condition
    suspension.discretionaryGround = DiscretionarySuspensionGround.ForeignCourtRequestPending
    consequence equals Yes

# Exemplary case pending
  label suspend_exemplary exception discretionary_default
  definition proceedingsCanBeSuspended under condition
    suspension.discretionaryGround = DiscretionarySuspensionGround.ExemplaryCasePending
    consequence equals Yes

# Evidence temporarily seized
  label suspend_seizure exception discretionary_default
  definition proceedingsCanBeSuspended under condition
    suspension.discretionaryGround = DiscretionarySuspensionGround.EvidenceTemporarilySeized
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 236. No suspension when representative acts

```catala
declaration scope Article236NoSuspensionRepresentative:
  input suspension content ProceedingSuspension
  output suspensionProhibited content YesNo

scope Article236NoSuspensionRepresentative:
  label prohibit_default definition suspensionProhibited equals No

  label prohibit_representative exception prohibit_default
  definition suspensionProhibited under condition
    suspension.participantHasRepresentative = Yes
    and suspension.discretionaryGround = DiscretionarySuspensionGround.ParticipantIllness
    consequence equals Yes

  label prohibit_trip_representative exception prohibit_default
  definition suspensionProhibited under condition
    suspension.participantHasRepresentative = Yes
    and suspension.discretionaryGround = DiscretionarySuspensionGround.ParticipantLongBusinessTrip
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 237. Resumption of proceedings

```catala
declaration scope Article237Resumption:
  input suspension content ProceedingSuspension
  input circumstancesEliminated content YesNo
  output proceedingsCanBeResumed content YesNo

scope Article237Resumption:
  label resume_default definition proceedingsCanBeResumed equals No

  label resume_available exception resume_default
  definition proceedingsCanBeResumed under condition
    circumstancesEliminated = Yes
    and suspension.suspensionResumedWithinTenDays = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 238. Closure of proceedings

```catala
declaration scope Article238Closure:
  input closure content ProceedingClosure
  output proceedingsMustBeClosed content YesNo
  output costsMustBeAllocated content YesNo

scope Article238Closure:
  label closure_default definition proceedingsMustBeClosed equals No

# Not administrative jurisdiction
  label closure_jurisdiction exception closure_default
  definition proceedingsMustBeClosed under condition
    closure.closureGround = ProceedingClosureGround.NotAdministrativeJurisdiction
    consequence equals Yes

# Plaintiff withdrew claim
  label closure_withdrawal exception closure_default
  definition proceedingsMustBeClosed under condition
    closure.closureGround = ProceedingClosureGround.PlaintiffWithdrewClaim
    consequence equals Yes

# Parties reconciled
  label closure_reconciliation exception closure_default
  definition proceedingsMustBeClosed under condition
    closure.closureGround = ProceedingClosureGround.PartiesReconciled
    consequence equals Yes

# Same case already closed
  label closure_res_judicata exception closure_default
  definition proceedingsMustBeClosed under condition
    closure.closureGround = ProceedingClosureGround.SameCaseAlreadyClosed
    consequence equals Yes

# Death without succession
  label closure_death exception closure_default
  definition proceedingsMustBeClosed under condition
    closure.closureGround = ProceedingClosureGround.DeathWithoutSuccession
    consequence equals Yes

# Normative act already invalidated
  label closure_normative exception closure_default
  definition proceedingsMustBeClosed under condition
    closure.closureGround = ProceedingClosureGround.NormativeActAlreadyInvalidated
    consequence equals Yes

# Individual act already cancelled
  label closure_individual exception closure_default
  definition proceedingsMustBeClosed under condition
    closure.closureGround = ProceedingClosureGround.IndividualActAlreadyCancelled
    consequence equals Yes

# Violations corrected by defendant
  label closure_corrected exception closure_default
  definition proceedingsMustBeClosed under condition
    closure.closureGround = ProceedingClosureGround.ViolationsCorrectedByDefendant
    consequence equals Yes

  label costs_on_closure definition costsMustBeAllocated under condition
    proceedingsMustBeClosed = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 239. Consequences of closure

```catala
declaration scope Article239ClosureConsequences:
  input closure content ProceedingClosure
  output repeatedFilingProhibited content YesNo
  output defendantMayFileSeparately content YesNo
  output courtMustExplainJurisdiction content YesNo

scope Article239ClosureConsequences:
# Repeated filing prohibited after closure
  label repeated_prohibited definition repeatedFilingProhibited under condition
    closure.closureGround != ProceedingClosureGround.PlaintiffWithdrewClaim
    consequence equals Yes

  label repeated_allowed definition repeatedFilingProhibited under condition
    closure.closureGround = ProceedingClosureGround.PlaintiffWithdrewClaim
    consequence equals No

# Defendant may still file even after plaintiff withdrawal
  label defendant_right definition defendantMayFileSeparately under condition
    closure.closureGround = ProceedingClosureGround.PlaintiffWithdrewClaim
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 240. Leaving claim without consideration

```catala
declaration scope Article240LeaveWithoutConsideration:
  input claim content ClaimWithoutConsideration
  input claimFiledBeforeMeritsStarted content YesNo
  output claimLeftWithoutConsideration content YesNo
  output costsCanBeAllocated content YesNo

scope Article240LeaveWithoutConsideration:
  label leave_default definition claimLeftWithoutConsideration equals No

# Plaintiff lacks procedural capacity
  label leave_capacity exception leave_default
  definition claimLeftWithoutConsideration under condition
    claim.ground = ClaimWithoutConsiderationGround.PlaintiffLacksProceduralCapacity
    consequence equals Yes

# Claim not properly signed
  label leave_unsigned exception leave_default
  definition claimLeftWithoutConsideration under condition
    claim.ground = ClaimWithoutConsiderationGround.ClaimNotSigned
    consequence equals Yes

# Duplicate case pending
  label leave_duplicate exception leave_default
  definition claimLeftWithoutConsideration under condition
    claim.ground = ClaimWithoutConsiderationGround.DuplicateCasePending
    consequence equals Yes

# Plaintiff repeatedly absent
  label leave_absent exception leave_default
  definition claimLeftWithoutConsideration under condition
    claim.ground = ClaimWithoutConsiderationGround.PlaintiffRepeatedlyAbsent
    consequence equals Yes

# Plaintiff requests leave without consideration
  label leave_request exception leave_default
  definition claimLeftWithoutConsideration under condition
    claim.ground = ClaimWithoutConsiderationGround.PlaintiffRequestsLeaveWithoutConsideration
    consequence equals Yes

# Protected person objects
  label leave_objection exception leave_default
  definition claimLeftWithoutConsideration under condition
    claim.ground = ClaimWithoutConsiderationGround.ProtectedPersonObjects
    consequence equals Yes

# Claim deficiencies not cured
  label leave_deficiencies exception leave_default
  definition claimLeftWithoutConsideration under condition
    claim.ground = ClaimWithoutConsiderationGround.ClaimDeficienciesNotCured
    consequence equals Yes

# Plaintiff failed to submit evidence
  label leave_evidence exception leave_default
  definition claimLeftWithoutConsideration under condition
    claim.ground = ClaimWithoutConsiderationGround.PlaintiffFailedToSubmitEvidence
    consequence equals Yes

# Duplicate claim same court
  label leave_duplicate_court exception leave_default
  definition claimLeftWithoutConsideration under condition
    claim.ground = ClaimWithoutConsiderationGround.DuplicateClaimSameCourt
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 240. Re-filing after leaving without consideration

```catala
declaration scope Article240Refiling:
  input claim content ClaimWithoutConsideration
  input groundCured content YesNo
  output refilingAllowed content YesNo

scope Article240Refiling:
  label refiling_default definition refilingAllowed equals No

  label refiling_allowed exception refiling_default
  definition refilingAllowed under condition
    groundCured = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```
